  "data": {
    "ruleType": "army-rule",
    "summary": "Each friendly **ORKS PSYKER** unit may use **psychic abilities** during a [battle round](vsdata:core-rule/start-of-battle-round) up to its own **psyker level** in total **psychic levels**. The unit’s level sets the allowance and each ability’s level sets its cost. A level 3 unit can, for example, use three level 1 abilities, a level 1 with a level 2, or a single level 3.",
